AltoStaking::setPauser()
├── when caller is not owner
│   └── it should revert
└── when caller is owner
    ├── when setting pauser for PAUSE_TYPE
    │   ├── when setting status to true
    │   │   └── it should enable pauser for PAUSE_TYPE
    │   └── when setting status to false
    │       └── it should disable pauser for PAUSE_TYPE
    └── when setting pauser for RESCUE_MODE_PAUSE_TYPE
        ├── when setting status to true
        │   └── it should enable pauser for RESCUE_MODE_PAUSE_TYPE
        └── when setting status to false
            └── it should disable pauser for RESCUE_MODE_PAUSE_TYPE

